  "description": "Code the Cosmos: A Space-Themed CTF Challenge Get ready to put your problem-solving, coding, and cybersecurity skills to the test in Code the Cosmos , an exciting space-themed Capture the Flag (CTF) competition! Participants will take on a series of engaging challenges involving cryptography, logical reasoning, coding, and cybersecurity, all woven into an immersive interstellar mission. Work individually or collaborate with your team to solve puzzles, uncover hidden clues, and climb the leaderboard. Whether you're an experienced coder or a curious beginner, this competition is an opportunity to challenge yourself, learn new skills, and experience the thrill of competitive problem-solving. Event Details: Date: 9th October 2026 Time: 11:00 AM onwards Mode: Hybrid (Online & Offline) Venue: NAC Auditorium Team Size: 1–4 members Think beyond boundaries, decode the unknown, and conquer the cosmos!",
